Hinweis / Notice

This repository contains an *overlay* for the M5Stack Cardputer dual-boot
setup. It does NOT contain the upstream firmware sources themselves.

- The ElicoftZ Flipper port (https://github.com/ElicoftZ/Flipper-Zero-meets-
  M5Stack-Cardputer) and the Bruce firmware (https://github.com/pr3y/Bruce)
  remain the property of their respective authors and are licensed under
  their own terms (Bruce: GNU AGPL-3.0). The .patch files under patches/
  only describe changes against those upstream projects and are provided for
  interoperability with the upstream codebases they patch.
- The prebuilt/ images are compiled from those upstream projects and are
  subject to the upstream licenses. Check the upstream repositories before
  redistributing them.
- This overlay itself (scripts, partition tables, sdkconfig overrides,
  documentation) is released under the MIT license above.
